-001 server signaling tests passed 7/7, but ICE restart/long-running renegotiation and background/terminated notification E2E remain open internal cases.\n- One real-GCS signed URL test remains skipped because its isolated non-production bucket was not configured; it is not counted as passed.\n\n## Merge policy\n**Draft only. Do not merge this PR, do not merge to `main`, and do not deploy.** The PR exists only to run permitted internal GitHub checks and preserve the audit trail.","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-11-21T21:22:30Z","updated_at":"2026-11-22T14:32:36Z","closed_at":"2026-11-22T14:00:37Z","merged_at":"2026-11-22T14:00:37Z","merge_commit_sha":"d4dc7399877f5aeafc2ca95422fc5a63324ab26f","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"productionhome2022-hash:codex/mawda-recovery-integration-2026-11-21","ref":"codex/mawda-recovery-integration-2026-11-21","repo":{"id":1446343181,"node_id":"R_kgDOVjVyDQ","name":"mawda-platform","full_name":"productionhome2022-hash/mawda-platform","owner":{"login":"productionhome2022-hash","id":348720557,"node_id":"U_kgDOFMkNrQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/348720557?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/productionhome2022-hash","html_url":"https://github.com/productionhome2022-hash","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/productionhome2022-hash/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/productionhome2022-hash/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/productionhome2022-hash/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/productionhome2022-hash/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/productionhome2022-hash/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/productionhome2022-hash/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/productionhome2022-hash/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/